---
description: All People Analytics data objects must start with people
alwaysApply: true
---

Every People Analytics database object, lake path, RPC, and pipeline dataset starts with `people`.

QuantReview leftovers in the shared staging `public` schema stay unprefixed on purpose. Do not rename or drop them.

```text
✅ people_mart_workforce_overview
✅ people_workspaces
✅ people_consume_ai_quota()
✅ data-platform/lake/people_bronze/

❌ workspaces
❌ serving.mart_workforce_overview
❌ consume_ai_quota()
❌ lake/bronze/
```

Workbench knowledge tables use `people_workbench_metrics`, not `people_metric_definitions`, so they do not collide with warehouse `people_metric_definition`.

Apply People v2 DDL only to the dedicated project PeopleAnalyticsAI.net (`zapmigfrtnwnkmezjefx`). Scripts must fail-closed on QuantReview production (`fyvivwgyisrtmehzjqlv`) and on `quantreview-staging` (`kgxbomcmgkwlmzyevqjw`). Staging v1 `public.people_*` stays live until cutover; do not clean its empty `people_v2` until step 9.
